<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Duel-Evolve: Reward-Free Test-Time Scaling via LLM Self-Preferences</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Sweta Karlekar<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">*</sup>
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
