<th id="S4.F2.3.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row" style="padding:0.5pt 4.0pt;">Few-shot CoT (<math id="S4.F2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k{=}8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k{=}8</annotation></semantics></math>)</th>
<td id="S4.F2.3.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding:0.5pt 4.0pt;">64.0</td></tr>
