<section id="A2.SS1.SSS6" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">B.1.6 </span>GEPA</h4>

<div id="A2.SS1.SSS6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.SSS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use a slightly modified prompt for GEPA, as their method optimizes the system prompt.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.SSS6.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS1.SSS6.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.SSS6.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">System prompt.</span></p>
