<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>GEPA Optimized Prompts</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Below we show the final optimized prompts found by GEPA for MathBench and LiveCodeBench.</p>
</div>
